      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "但是原来的中断只有HAL_IncTick(),\n没有对其他的中断处理，需要在中断函数加上这个",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "但是原来的中断只有HAL_IncTick(),\n没有对其他的中断处理，需要在中断函数加上这个",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oLbJ4NFVZ_aRdjGa5pzO1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3609.7658904335126,
      "y": -683.6589387224799,
      "width": 943.5250244140625,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bqI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 378617413,
      "version": 250,
      "versionNonce": 1304622341,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1761903577420,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "systick在中断中实现uwTick对应处理，\n最终作用到HAL_Delay()上,位整个系统提供基准的时钟频率",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "systick在中断中实现uwTick对应处理，\n最终作用到HAL_Delay()上,位整个系统提供基准的时钟频率",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
